sequenceDiagram
    actor Buyer as 买家
    actor Seller as 商品卖家
    participant UI as Vue/Nginx
    participant API as SecondhandTradeController
    participant Service as SecondhandTradeServiceImpl
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant SideEffect as Chat/Notification/Realtime

    Buyer->>UI: 输入报价并发送
    UI->>API: POST /bargain/apply
    API->>Service: applyBargain
    Service->>DB: 校验商品、价格、重复有效议价
    Service->>DB: INSERT APPLIED
    DB-->>Service: commit
    Service-->>SideEffect: 提交后发送聊天卡片和通知
    Seller->>UI: 打开买家消息
    UI->>API: GET /bargain/list
    API->>DB: 查询当前卖家相关记录
    Seller->>UI: 同意并生成订单或拒绝
    UI->>API: POST /bargain/confirm 或 /reject
    API->>Service: 条件更新 APPLIED
    alt 确认成功
        Service->>DB: 商品 1 -> 3，写待付款订单和明细，议价 -> USED
    else 拒绝成功
        Service->>DB: 议价 -> REJECTED
    else 已被并发处理
        Service-->>UI: 409 请刷新
    end
    DB-->>Service: commit
    Service-->>SideEffect: 提交后同步结果
    Buyer->>UI: 刷新并查看结果/待付款订单
